      "dedupe_key": "efg-london-jazz-festival-sounds-of-diaspora|2026-11-13|barbican",
      "description": "Celebrate the rich musical heritage of Trinidad and Tobago with Endurance Steel, the musicians who have shaped its legacy across the diaspora. Join us for a morning celebrating the rich musical heritage of Trinidad and Tobago and its enduring influence across the diaspora. Through a vibrant mixed-ensemble performance, the programme traces the journey of the steelpan from its Caribbean roots to its place on the world stage, showcasing a diverse repertoire that spans traditional and contemporary works. Performed by one of the UK's leading steel orchestras, the concert highlights the versatility, power and beauty of the national instrument of Trinidad and Tobago while honouring the generations of musicians who have shaped its legacy. Endurance Steel Orchestra is a South East London-based organisation dedicated to youth development, community engagement and musical excellence through the art of steelpan.",
      "ends_at": null,
      "image_url": "https://www.barbican.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/event_listing_small_jpg/public/images/2026-06/Sounds%20of%20Diaspora.jpg?itok=UrPR4TTt",
